    {
      "target": "제 생각이 잘못돼서 다시 설명할게요.",
      "reading": "je saenggagi jalmotdwaeseo dasi seolmyeonghalgeyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "My idea was wrong, so I will explain again.",
        "ko": "제 생각이 잘못돼서 다시 설명할게요.",
        "ipa": "je saenggagi jalmotdwaeseo dasi seolmyeonghalgeyo.",
        "ar": "كان فهمي خاطئًا، لذلك سأشرح مرة أخرى.",
        "cs": "Mýlil jsem se, tak to vysvětlím znovu.",
        "da": "Min idé var forkert, så jeg forklarer det igen.",
        "de": "Mein Gedanke war falsch, also erkläre ich es noch einmal.",
